      "1. Add a new object to the 'cheatsheet' array.",
      "2. Set 'service' to the AWS service name.",
      "3. Set 'icon' to an emoji representing the service.",
      "4. Set 'category' to one of: Compute, Storage, Database, Networking, Security, Integration, Analytics, Serverless, Management, Migration, Containers, Cost, Machine Learning, Media, Frontend, Developer Tools, Other.",
      "5. Write a short one-liner 'description' of what the service does.",
      "6. Add relevant 'keywords' as an array of strings — include exam-relevant terms.",
      "7. Upload resources.json to S3 and hard-refresh the site."
    ],
